@startuml UserConfig
' ====================================================================
' Sequence diagram - PIN change via menu (v4_main.ino)
' From IDLE, press # with no digits -> menu -> validate old PIN
' -> enter new PIN -> pinIsUnique check -> rotatePin -> save
' Covers both normal change and pinChangeRequired scenario
' ====================================================================

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "User" as USR #FFFACD
participant "Keypad 4x4\nD29,D31,D33,D35" as KPD #D4E6F1
participant "System\n(loop)" as SYS #FFCCCC
participant "EEPROM" as EEP #D4E6F1
participant "LCD 16x2\nRS=12 EN=11" as LCD #D4E6F1

== IDLE - entering menu mode ==
note right: State S_IDLE\nLCD: "IDLE", "Enter PIN:"\nRGB: off

USR -> KPD: Presses '#' (no digits)
KPD -> SYS: getKey() = '#'
SYS -> SYS: handlePinEntry('#')\npinLen == 0 -> menu mode
SYS -> SYS: menuActive = true, menuStep = 0
LCD -> SYS: "CHANGE PIN"\n"Old PIN:----"

== Menu Step 0: Enter old PIN ==
USR -> KPD: Presses '1','2','3','4'
KPD -> SYS: getKey() = digits
SYS -> SYS: menuBuf = "1234", menuBufLen = 4

USR -> KPD: Presses '#' (confirm old PIN)
KPD -> SYS: getKey() = '#'
SYS -> EEP: findUserByPin("1234")
EEP --> SYS: userIdx = 2
SYS -> SYS: menuUserIdx = 2, menuStep = 1
LCD -> SYS: LCD: "CHANGE PIN"\n"New PIN:----"
note right: Old PIN validated\nProceeding to new PIN entry

== Menu Step 1: Enter new PIN ==
USR -> KPD: Presses '5','6','7','8'
KPD -> SYS: getKey() = digits
SYS -> SYS: menuBuf = "5678", menuBufLen = 4

USR -> KPD: Presses '#' (confirm new PIN)
KPD -> SYS: getKey() = '#'
SYS -> EEP: pinIsUnique(2, "5678")
note right: Checks current PIN + 4 history entries\nMust differ from ALL previous PINs
EEP --> SYS: true (unique)
SYS -> EEP: rotatePin(2, "5678")
note right: saveUser(userIdx, newPin,\nrole, uses=0, histIdx+1,\noldPin pushed to history[histIdx])
SYS -> SYS: if pinChangeRequired AND\npinChangeUserIdx == menuUserIdx:\npinChangeRequired = false
SYS -> LCD: "PIN changed!"\n"OK"
note right: Confirmation shown\nfor 1.5 seconds (delay(1500))
SYS -> SYS: closeMenu()
note right: Resets menu flags\nClears all buffers

== Alternative: PIN expired forced change ==
note right: If uses >= PIN_MAX_USES(4)\nprevious access set pinChangeRequired
USR -> KPD: Enters old PIN + '#'
KPD -> SYS: getKey() = digits + #
SYS -> EEP: findUserByPin(pinBuf)
EEP --> SYS: Found: userIdx == pinChangeUserIdx
SYS -> SYS: "PIN expired. Change via menu"\nAccess DENIED
note right: User MUST go through\nmenu (# at IDLE) to change PIN\nbefore accessing again

== Alternative: Cancel ==
USR -> KPD: Presses '*'
KPD -> SYS: getKey() = '*'
SYS -> SYS: closeMenu()
LCD -> SYS: "IDLE"\n"Enter PIN:"
note right: Any time during menu\n'*' calls closeMenu()\nreturns to IDLE, buffers cleared

@enduml
